WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.800
Manually answering security questionnaires is slow and painful.

2
00:00:05.800 --> 00:00:10.239
Meet DocAgent, the AI-powered compliance engine.

3
00:00:11.239 --> 00:00:15.019
Watch how it automates the process in real-time.

4
00:00:15.019 --> 00:00:18.638
First, it reads the input question.

5
00:00:19.638 --> 00:00:31.438
Then, it identifies the target reference file, opens the spreadsheet containing over one hundred policy rows, and automatically scrolls to scan the clauses.

6
00:00:31.438 --> 00:00:43.072
The robot locates the exact evidence row, highlighting the matched compliance clause in a precision blue box, and extracts the verified answer directly into our dashboard.

7
00:00:55.000 --> 00:01:05.105
Each question takes only seconds, automatically sorting answers into green, yellow, or red confidence tiers with verifiable citations.

8
00:01:15.000 --> 00:01:23.960
DocAgent supports secure, self-hosted containerized deployment, ensuring your company data never leaves your environment.

9
00:01:24.960 --> 00:01:31.009
Accelerate your RFP response and compliance audit cycles from weeks to minutes.

10
00:01:32.509 --> 00:01:37.138
Contact us today to schedule your custom enterprise pilot.

